       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-UNIFORM-LOGIC.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-UNIFORM-LOGIC-PROOFS.
           05  WS-CUT-ELIMINATION-SOUND    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-POLARIZED-FOCUSED-SEARCH PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LAMBEK-RESIDUAL-MONOID   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-EXPONENTIAL-MODALITY-GAT PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-UNIFORM-LOGIC-CANON-SEAL PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-UNIFORM-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-UNIFORM-PROVEN       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-UNIFORM-CODE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-CUT-AND-FOCUSING.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-MONOID-AND-EXPONENTIALS.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-UNIFORM-LOGIC-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-CUT-AND-FOCUSING.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CUT-ELIMINATION-SOUND.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-POLARIZED-FOCUSED-SEARCH.
       2000-EVALUATE-MONOID-AND-EXPONENTIALS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LAMBEK-RESIDUAL-MONOID.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-EXPONENTIAL-MODALITY-GAT.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-UNIFORM-LOGIC-PROOFS.
           IF WS-CUT-ELIMINATION-SOUND = 1 AND
              WS-POLARIZED-FOCUSED-SEARCH = 1 AND
              WS-LAMBEK-RESIDUAL-MONOID = 1 AND
              WS-EXPONENTIAL-MODALITY-GAT = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-UNIFORM-LOGIC-CANON-SEAL
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-UNIFORM-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-UNIFORM-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-UNIFORM-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-UNIFORM-CODE.
